The doctor gave me medicine, so I feel a little better.
The teacher explained to me about the IELTS almost every day.
I didn&rsquo;t know why&hellip;Should I take the IELTS??😂
I also talked about the exam with another teacher.
I told him, &ldquo;My TOEIC score is 540 points, but I need 700 points.&rdquo;
He told me, &ldquo;Your score will increase immediately!&rdquo;
I&rsquo;ll take the TOEIC exam next week after I return to Japan.
To be honest, I don&rsquo;t think I can get a high score.
